des<br></li><li>18 Levels Across 6 Stages<br></li><li>10 Versus Levels<br></li><li>12 Playable Characters<br></li><li>Character Customisation </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/269850/extras/54e4d433b6cbea26da05f0eff7322646.poster.avif?t=1688544216\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/269850/extras/54e4d433b6cbea26da05f0eff7322646.webm?t=1688544216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/269850/extras/54e4d433b6cbea26da05f0eff7322646.mp4?t=1688544216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
